---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const posts = [
  {
    title: "50 Free Online Tools That Actually Work (No Signup Needed)",
    slug: "/blog/50-free-online-tools",
    date: "October 7, 2026",
    readTime: "9 min read",
    excerpt:
      "Finance calculators, image tools, PDF utilities, converters and more — 50 genuinely free tools with no signup, no paywall and no watermark. Click a card and start.",
  },
  {
    title: "SIP vs RD: Which One Grows Your Money Better?",
    slug: "/blog/sip-vs-rd",
    date: "October 15, 2026",
    readTime: "7 min read",
    excerpt:
      "Same ₹5,000 a month, two very different journeys. How SIPs and recurring deposits actually work, an honest side-by-side example, and how risk, inflation and tax decide which one suits your goal.",
  },
  {
    title: "How to Merge, Split and Compress PDF Files for Free",
    slug: "/blog/how-to-merge-pdf-files",
    date: "October 15, 2026",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    excerpt:
      "The form wants one PDF and you have five — or the file is too big to send. Step-by-step merging, splitting, reordering and compressing with free browser tools, no signup and no watermark.",
  },
  {
    title: "How to Reduce Photo Size Without Losing Quality",
    slug: "/blog/reduce-photo-size",
    date: "October 15, 2026",
    readTime: "7 min read",
    excerpt:
      "Your photo is 5.8 MB and the form allows 200 KB. The two levers — resizing and compression — explained, with exact steps for forms, WhatsApp sharing and printing.",
  },
  {
    title: "Home Loan EMI: How It Is Calculated, and How to Pay Less Interest",
    slug: "/blog/home-loan-emi-guide",
    date: "October 15, 2026",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    excerpt:
      "Your EMI is not just the loan divided by months. How the interest is really calculated, why early payments are mostly interest, and the honest levers — tenure and prepayment — that cut the total cost.",
  },
  {
    title: "How to Make a GST Invoice: A Simple Guide for Freelancers and Small Businesses in India",
    slug: "/blog/gst-invoice-guide",
    date: "October 15, 2026",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    excerpt:
      "GSTIN, HSN codes, CGST vs IGST — an invoice has rules, and getting them wrong costs you clients. What every GST invoice must contain, explained simply, with a step-by-step you can follow.",
  },
  {
    title: "Resume Mistakes That Get You Rejected (and How to Fix Each One)",
    slug: "/blog/resume-mistakes",
    date: "October 15, 2026",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    excerpt:
      "Most resumes are rejected for fixable reasons: generic templates, no numbers, walls of text, and keywords the scanner never finds. The common mistakes, one by one, with the fix for each.",
  },
  {
    title: "BMI Explained: What Your Number Means, and What It Does Not",
    slug: "/blog/bmi-explained",
    date: "October 15, 2026",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    excerpt:
      "One number, calculated in seconds — and misunderstood just as fast. How BMI works, where the standard ranges come from, why it misleads for athletes and body types, and what to track alongside it.",
  },
  {
    title: "Word Counts That Matter: Essays, Resumes, Posts and Applications",
    slug: "/blog/word-count-guide",
    date: "October 15, 2026",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    excerpt:
      "Too short looks thin, too long gets skimmed or cut. Typical lengths for essays, resumes, cover letters, posts and statements of purpose — and how to hit the mark without padding.",
  },
  {
    title: "JPG vs PNG vs WebP vs AVIF: Which Image Format Should You Use?",
    slug: "/blog/jpg-vs-png-vs-webp",
    date: "October 15, 2026",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    excerpt:
      "Same photo, four formats, wildly different file sizes. What each format is actually good at, where each one fails, and a simple way to pick the right one for websites, forms, print and sharing.",
  },
  {
    title: "JSON Errors Explained: Why Your JSON Will Not Parse (and How to Fix It)",
    slug: "/blog/json-errors-explained",
    date: "October 15, 2026",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    excerpt:
      "A trailing comma, a single quote, one bracket too many — JSON fails for a handful of small reasons. The usual suspects with before-and-after examples, and a workflow that finds them fast.",
  },
